### VS Code ###
.vscode/

### Runtime data ###
# app.event-images.storage-dir's default (./data/event-images) -- uploaded event
# images, local runtime state, never source.
/data/

### Local secrets ###
# Real Stripe test-mode values -- a genuinely sensitive credential, unlike every other
# credential this repo has committed so far (see issue #25). Copy
# application-local.properties.example to this filename and fill in your own values;
# it's picked up as a Spring profile override when SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=local.
src/main/resources/application-local.properties
